<title>NETHERLANDS: Ahold Q3 net profit 156.4 million.</title>
<headline>Ahold Q3 net profit 156.4 million.</headline>
<dateline>ZAANDAM, Netherlands 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third quarter 1996</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     0.93  vs   0.81</p>
<p>    Net profit			   156.4   vs 101.6</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  9.27  vs   6.94</p>
<p>Note - Koninklijke Ahold NV was expected by analysts to report a net profit of 134 to 170 million guilders.  </p>
<p>    Dividend on preferred shares     4.2   vs nil</p>
<p>Net profit after dividend</p>
<p>    on preferred shares		152.2   vs 101.6</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   307.6   vs 211.0</p>
<p>    Financial charges		   87.9   vs  61.8</p>
<p>    Tax				     53.0   vs  37.6</p>
<p>    Minority interests		  10.3   vs  10.0</p>
<p>NOTES - Supermarkets group Koninklijke Ahold NV said the average dollar exchange rate in the third quarter was 1.68 guilders vs 1.61 a year ago.  </p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
